@startuml
title TaskMasterWeb - Container Overview

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 250
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "User" as User

node "TaskMasterWeb" as System {
  rectangle "Webserver\n(Python)\nHost 9652" as Web
  rectangle "Atlas API\n(FastAPI / Uvicorn)\nContainer 8000\nHost 8199" as API
  database "MySQL 8\nContainer 3306\nHost 33066" as DB
  folder "JSON Storage\nAtomic writes (.tmp -> replace)\nSoft deletes (deleted:true)" as FS
}

rectangle "Weaviate\nVector DB\nHost 8092 -> 8080\n(+ gRPC 50051)" as Weaviate
rectangle "SonarQube\nCode Quality\nHost 9010 -> 9000\n(latest community)" as Sonar
rectangle "PlantUML Server\nDiagram Render\nHost 8010 -> 8080" as PlantUML

User --> Web : HTTP
Web --> API : HTTP JSON
API --> DB : SQL
API --> FS : Atomic JSON I/O
API --> Weaviate : HTTP / gRPC
API --> Sonar : Webhooks / links
Web --> Sonar : Link to dashboard
User --> Sonar : View reports
API --> PlantUML : Render diagrams (opt)
User --> PlantUML : Preview (opt)

note right of FS
  Base dir per project\n
  Fallback: /workspace/taskmaster\n
  Merge tasks.json (root + .taskmaster)
end note

note bottom of API
  CORS from HOST_PORT\n
  Routes: /{project_slug}/task\n
  Concurrency via portalocker
end note

@enduml